# Store text files with LF in the repository and check them out with the platform's line endings.
* text=auto

# Binary files: never touch line endings or diff them as text.
*.png binary
# Vendored minified scripts: kept byte for byte as published, so their hashes match upstream (THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).
*.min.js binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
